"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[5046],{15046:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"schemaVersion":1,"locale":"en","slug":"servisy","title":"Reference Guide. Services and Sources: Official Registries, Services, and Intermediary Verification","sourceFingerprint":"c8a0647833fb5f9f5b4e5df7e92f54f316bfe02acaf38e5ae66026844e97e187","blocks":[{"id":"b001","markdown":"# Investor\'s Navigator: Verified Portals and Primary Sources of Figures"},{"id":"b002","markdown":"> \\"The intelligent investor relies on regulatory acts, regulator registries, and primary statistics, rather than on the promises of advertising banners and speculations of financial bloggers.\\""},{"id":"b003","markdown":"Any practical actions with money require one hundred percent confidence in two things: the legal integrity of the financial intermediary and the reliability of macroeconomic indicators."},{"id":"b004","markdown":"To avoid falling victim to cloned phishing websites, do not search for government portals and registries via general search engine results. Save this page to your permanent browser bookmarks—before you is an official, verified directory."},{"id":"b005","markdown":"## \uD83C\uDFDB Action Registries: Where to Solve Legal and Tax Tasks"},{"id":"b006","markdown":"This section brings together official digital services for legalizing transactions, claiming tax refunds, and verifying licenses."},{"id":"b007","markdown":"| Area | Official Resource | Practical Application |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **Legality Verification** | **Bank of Russia (Registry of Participants)**<br>`cbr.ru/finorg` | Quick audit of a broker, exchange intermediary, management company, or NPF. If an organization is absent from the CBR lists, any contact and money transfers are completely ruled out. |\\n| **Protection of Rights** | **CBR Online Reception**<br>`cbr.ru/reception` | Filing an official complaint in case of misselling (when an ILI, ELI policy or structured notes were imposed under the guise of a regular deposit). Regulatory appeals initiate bank audits. |\\n| **Records and Public Services** | **Gosuslugi Portal**<br>`gosuslugi.ru` | Tracking accumulated IPC (pension coefficients), two-factor identity verification when opening brokerage accounts remotely, and, starting October 1, 2025, the unified registry of long-term savings contracts. |\\n| **Tax Deductions** | **FTS Personal Account**<br>`lkfl2.nalog.ru` | Remote filing for an annual personal income tax refund (up to 52,000–88,000 ₽) on IIS-3 accounts and long-term savings contracts (3-NDFL tax declaration or simplified deduction). |\\n| **Social Status** | **Social Fund of Russia**<br>`sfr.gov.ru` | Statement from the individual personal account (ILS), verification of employment history, pension rights, and reconciliation of basic social calculations. |\\n| **Deposit Guarantees** | **Deposit Insurance Agency**<br>`asv.org.ru` | Verifying a credit institution\'s participation in the state deposit insurance system (insurance limit of 1.4 million ₽ per individual per bank, including accrued interest). |"},{"id":"b008","markdown":"## \uD83D\uDCCA Primary Sources of Macroeconomic Statistics: Where the Numbers Come From"},{"id":"b009","markdown":"The economy is dynamic: the key rate is reviewed every six weeks, bond yields fluctuate daily, and legislation is updated. Never rely on secondary retellings—verify the original data yourself."},{"id":"b010","markdown":"* **Bank of Russia (`cbr.ru`):** actual key rate level, average interest rates on banking products, weighted average performance of retail accounts for the 2023–2025 period, analytical reviews of systemic flaws in ILI products, and macroeconomic consensus forecasts.\\n* **Moscow Exchange (`moex.com`):** exchange indicators, total return index performance including dividend reinvestment (MCFTR), sovereign ruble bond index (RGBI), dynamics of money market exchange-traded funds (LQDT and equivalents), and retail account activity statistics.\\n* **Rosstat (`rosstat.gov.ru`):** official consumer price index (CPI), core inflation calculation methodology, and dynamics of average monthly accrued wages by industry.\\n* **Ministry of Finance of the Russian Federation (`minfin.gov.ru`):** parameters of sovereign OFZ bond issues (including the debut tranche of Chinese yuan bonds announced for December 2025) and the regulatory framework for co-financing the long-term savings program.\\n* **Morningstar (\\"Mind the Gap\\" study, `morningstar.com`):** a global analytical report recording the systemic gap between mutual fund returns and the actual financial results of retail investors caused by emotional market timing.\\n* **S&P Dow Jones Indices (SPIVA reports, `spglobal.com`):** long-term statistics on benchmark outperformance versus active managers. According to data at the end of 2024, 89.5% of actively managed US large-cap equity funds underperformed the broad S&P 500 index over a 15-year horizon."},{"id":"b011","markdown":"## \uD83E\uDDEE Margin Calculation: The Difference Between Myth and Primary Source"},{"id":"b012","markdown":"Imagine an investment manager promising you a \\"reliable defensive instrument yielding 5% above a deposit, guaranteed by the state system.\\""},{"id":"b013","markdown":"```\\n1. Registry verification step:\\n   Visit cbr.ru/finorg -> company is missing from the broker/management company registry.\\n   Conclusion: Illegal intermediary (100% capital loss)."},{"id":"b014","markdown":"2. Licensed misselling verification step:\\n   The company is listed on cbr.ru, but the manager offers an insurance policy.\\n   Visit asv.org.ru -> ILI/ELI policies and mutual fund investments are NOT insured by the DIA.\\n   The 1.4 million ₽ limit applies exclusively to traditional bank deposits and accounts."},{"id":"b015","markdown":"3. Inflation cross-check step:\\n   Visit rosstat.gov.ru: official core inflation for the year = 8.4%.\\n   Offered yield on the \\"guaranteed\\" portfolio = 8.0%.\\n   Real pre-tax yield: 8.0% - 8.4% = -0.4% per annum.\\n```"},{"id":"b016","markdown":"Relying on three official clicks preserves capital far more effectively than hundreds of hours of dubious investment webinars."},{"id":"b017","markdown":"## \uD83D\uDCDA MakeCash Academy Educational Ecosystem"},{"id":"b018","markdown":"This guide deliberately omits the names of specific commercial banks and brokerage firms: the methodology for their objective selection is covered in detail in the Broker Selection Practicum, and the principles of auditing exchange-traded funds are outlined in Lesson 6."},{"id":"b019","markdown":"To build a comprehensive capital framework, explore the adjacent modules of the `makecash.pro` ecosystem:"},{"id":"b020","markdown":"1. **Volume I \\"Financial Foundation: From Accounting to Reserve\\"** — eliminating credit traps, calculating an emergency fund, protecting against fraudulent schemes, and automating basic deductions.\\n2. **Personal Inflation Analytical Tracker** — a calculator comparing Rosstat\'s official consumer price index across 59 staple goods with your family\'s actual expenses since 2010.\\n3. **Practicum \\"Cryptocurrency and Stablecoins: Cold Calculation\\"** — breakdown of digital currency mechanics, smart contracts of asset-backed stablecoins (USDT), blocking risks, and private key storage rules."},{"id":"b021","markdown":"## ✍️ Step-by-Step Investor Checklist: Source Audit"},{"id":"b022","markdown":"Before sending money to a brokerage account, making a contribution to an NPF, or signing a financial contract, check off each item:"},{"id":"b023","markdown":"- [ ] **License verified at the primary source.** The organization is found in the Bank of Russia registry (`cbr.ru/finorg`), and the legal entity name and OGRN match the details in the contract.\\n- [ ] **Insurance status confirmed.** If opening a bank deposit, its availability and protection parameters up to 1.4 million ₽ are verified on the Deposit Insurance Agency website (`asv.org.ru`).\\n- [ ] **Tax base prepared.** Access to the Taxpayer\'s Personal Account (`lkfl2.nalog.ru`) is active, and a password has been generated to verify deductions for IIS-3 or PDS contracts.\\n- [ ] **Returns cleared of illusions.** Advertised promises are compared with SPIVA statistics (`spglobal.com`) and the official Rosstat inflation rate (`rosstat.gov.ru`).\\n- [ ] **Direct links saved.** Access to financial platforms is performed exclusively via verified browser bookmarks, not through links from search engines or emails."}],"terms":[{"id":"reestr-cbr","term":"Bank of Russia Register","definition":"the official directory of licensed financial organizations."},{"id":"priemnaya-cbr","term":"Bank of Russia Online Reception","definition":"a channel for filing complaints against unfair practices of financial organizations."},{"id":"lk-fns","term":"FTS Personal Account","definition":"a government service for filing tax deductions and declarations."}],"quizzes":[{"id":"q1","q":"Where can a retail investor reliably verify whether a broker or management company holds an active license?","options":["In the official register of financial organizations on the Bank of Russia portal (cbr.ru/finorg)","In promotional reviews on forums and anonymous Telegram channels","In the mobile app of any marketplace"],"correct":0,"explanation":"The only reliable primary source for the licensing status of financial intermediaries is the official register of the Bank of Russia."},{"id":"q2","q":"Through which official service can one apply for an IIA tax deduction without visiting a tax office?","options":["The taxpayer\'s personal account on the Federal Tax Service website (lkfl2.nalog.ru) or via Gosuslugi","Via a messenger chatbot","The deduction is granted only upon an in-person visit to the local tax office"],"correct":0,"explanation":"The FTS taxpayer personal account (lkfl2.nalog.ru) allows submitting a 3-NDFL tax return or applying for a simplified deduction entirely online."},{"id":"q3","q":"Which state organization provides insurance compensation payouts for bank deposits and Long-Term Savings Program (LSP) contracts upon license revocation?","options":["The Ministry of Finance of the Russian Federation directly","The State Corporation \'Deposit Insurance Agency\' (DIA, asv.org.ru)","Any private insurance company of the depositor\'s choice"],"correct":1,"explanation":"The DIA (Deposit Insurance Agency) is the authorized state corporation for savings insurance."}],"officialSources":[{"title":"Bank of Russia (Register of Financial Organizations)","url":"https://cbr.ru/finorg","description":"Verification of active licenses of brokers, non-state pension funds (NPFs), and management companies."},{"title":"Bank of Russia Online Reception","url":"https://cbr.ru/reception","description":"Official complaint submission in cases of misselling and imposition of insurance products."},{"title":"Taxpayer Personal Account of the Federal Tax Service of Russia","url":"https://lkfl2.nalog.ru","description":"Remote application for tax deductions under IIA-3 and the Long-Term Savings Program (LSP)."},{"title":"Gosuslugi Portal","url":"https://gosuslugi.ru","description":"Monitoring pension points, identity verification, and registry of LSP contracts."},{"title":"Social Fund of Russia (SFR)","url":"https://sfr.gov.ru","description":"Obtaining an individual personal account statement (ILS) and verifying work history."},{"title":"Deposit Insurance Agency (DIA)","url":"https://asv.org.ru","description":"Verification of banks\' and NPFs\' participation in the savings insurance system."},{"title":"Moscow Exchange (MOEX)","url":"https://moex.com","description":"Official OFZ quotes, RUSFAR rates, and exchange-traded fund parameters."},{"title":"NAPF (National Association of Non-State Pension Funds)","url":"https://napf.ru","description":"LSP calculator, calculation of state co-funding, and comparison of program operators."}]}')}}]);